      "presentation": {
        "title": "Route once, independent of provider",
        "body": "Brama accepts one routing request and selects the configured provider/model route behind it. Your application keeps the same message contract while routes, aliases, and subscription-backed selection can change independently. Provider credentials and caller authentication are provisioned separately; onboarding never creates or changes them."
      }
    },
